# As `crust/`'s and `shell/clap`'s: what cargo makes again is not
# source.  The lock too — the pure half of this crate has no
# dependencies at all, and the window's are pinned by the workspace.
#
# It was missing for exactly one session, and five hundred build
# artifacts turned up staged for commit before anyone noticed.  Each
# crate carries its own so that a cargo run from inside it is covered
# as well as one from the root.
target/
Cargo.lock
